{"format":1,"kind":"spi","name":"lis3dh","label":"ST LIS3DH: 3-axis accelerometer (SPI)","description":"Direct reads of the data registers: the output follows the full scale (CTRL_REG4 FS), the\noperating mode (low-power, normal or high-resolution: 8, 10 or 12 bits, left-justified), the\noutput data rate and axis enables (CTRL_REG1: power-down and disabled axes read 0) and the\nbyte order (CTRL_REG4 BLE). SPI mode 3, address bit 7 selects a read, bit 6 auto increment.\n\nFor a DUT that reads through the FIFO, use `lis3dh_fifo`: the pod pops its FIFO on every read\nof OUT_X_L, so one definition cannot serve both ways.\n","datasheet":"https://www.st.com/en/mems-and-sensors/lis3dh.html","version":"1.0.0","license":"Apache-2.0","params":[{"key":"accel_x_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":0,"label":"X"},{"key":"accel_y_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":0,"label":"Y"},{"key":"accel_z_g","unit":"g","min":-16,"max":16,"default":1,"label":"Z"}],"spi":{"mode":3,"read_bit":{"bit":7,"value":1},"increment_bit":{"bit":6,"value":1},"address_mask":63},"functions":{"sample":{"args":["g","en"],"let":[{"v":"clamp(round(g * 1000 / sens), -(1 << (nbits - 1)), (1 << (nbits - 1)) - 1)"}],"return":"on && en ? v << (16 - nbits) : 0"},"out":{"args":["w","n"],"return":"ble ? byte(w, 1 - n) : byte(w, n)"}},"let":[{"odr":"bits(reg[0x20], 7, 4)"},{"lp":"bit(reg[0x20], 3)"},{"hr":"bit(reg[0x23], 3) && !lp"},{"fs":"bits(reg[0x23], 5, 4)"},{"ble":"bit(reg[0x23], 6)"},{"on":"odr != 0 && odr <= 9"},{"nbits":"lp ? 8 : hr ? 12 : 10"},{"sens":"lp ? [16, 32, 64, 192][fs] : hr ? [1, 2, 4, 12][fs] : [4, 8, 16, 48][fs]"},{"wx":"sample(accel_x_g, bit(reg[0x20], 0))"},{"wy":"sample(accel_y_g, bit(reg[0x20], 1))"},{"wz":"sample(accel_z_g, bit(reg[0x20], 2))"}],"registers":[{"at":7,"u8":0,"name":"STATUS_REG_AUX"},{"at":15,"u8":51,"name":"WHO_AM_I","writable":false},{"at":30,"u8":16,"name":"CTRL_REG0"},{"at":31,"u8":0,"name":"TEMP_CFG_REG"},{"at":32,"u8":7,"name":"CTRL_REG1"},{"at":33,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG2"},{"at":34,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG3"},{"at":35,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG4"},{"at":36,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG5"},{"at":37,"u8":0,"name":"CTRL_REG6"},{"at":38,"u8":0,"name":"REFERENCE"},{"at":39,"u8":"on ? 0x0F : 0x00","name":"STATUS_REG"},{"at":40,"name":"OUT_X_L","bytes":["out(wx, 0)","out(wx, 1)","out(wy, 0)","out(wy, 1)","out(wz, 0)","out(wz, 1)"]},{"at":46,"u8":0,"name":"FIFO_CTRL_REG"},{"at":47,"u8":32,"name":"FIFO_SRC_REG","writable":false}]}
